<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$92.0 mln trade deficit in November.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$92.0 mln trade deficit in November.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Friday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for November.</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Nov 1996	    Oct 1996	     Nov 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$92.0 million	  -$165.5 million	  -$285.4 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.75 billion     $1.73 bln	    $1.72 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.84 billion     $1.90 bln	    $2.00 bln</p>
<p>		Yr-to-Nov 1996    Yr-to-Oct 1996     Yr-to-Nov 1995</p>
<p>Balance    -$399.4 million	 -$592.8 million	  -$171.7 million</p>
<p>Exports     $21.01 bln	  $20.98 bln	   $21.04 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $21.41 bln	  $21.57 bln	   $21.21 bln</p>
<p>Trend series:</p>
<p>		Nov 1996	    Oct 1996	     Nov 1995</p>
<p>Balance     $25.6 million	   $16.8 million	   -$54.3 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.77 billion     $1.77 bln	    $1.73 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.74 billion     $1.76 bln	    $1.78 bln</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
